sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant UI as M01 桌面交互
    participant APP as M02 应用协调
    participant ST as M07 状态与契约
    participant G as M03 ResearchLoopGraph

    U->>UI: 重新启动应用并选择历史会话
    UI->>ST: SessionStore.load()
    ST-->>UI: 会话、消息和 trace 展示投影
    UI->>APP: get_snapshot(session_id)
    APP->>ST: 读取 SQLite checkpoint
    ST->>ST: 检查 graph_schema_version 与安全迁移
    ST-->>APP: 权威 ResearchLoopState
    APP->>G: 恢复当前 thread 快照
    G-->>APP: phase、interrupt、工具队列与事件
    APP-->>UI: ResearchLoopSnapshot
    UI->>UI: 从快照和事件重建方案卡、进度和结果状态
    UI-->>U: 显示可继续的审批、修复或结果交互
    Note over UI,ST: 会话文件只恢复展示；Graph checkpoint 决定运行语义

